                        "sense_id": "8ad9f885-3397-35e1-a27b-cc8bd1b53527",
                        "entry_id": "58ff0ece-83ed-3f8b-ab4b-6d8953a4a322",
                        "glosses": [
                            "sensational"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae18e0f0-6240-4ae4-b6a2-760826204ae7",
                                "sense_id": "8ad9f885-3397-35e1-a27b-cc8bd1b53527",
                                "text": "Бог знает почему, Иванов ли тут был виноват, или потому, что сенсационные известия передаются сами собой по воздуху, но только в гигантской кипящей Москве вдруг заговорили о луче и о профессоре Персикове.",
                                "translation": "Goodness only knows why, perhaps Ivanov was to blame or perhaps the sensational news just travelled through the air on its own, but in the huge seething city of Moscow people suddenly started talking about the ray and Professor Persikov.",
                                "english": "Goodness only knows why, perhaps Ivanov was to blame or perhaps the sensational news just travelled through the air on its own, but in the huge seething city of Moscow people suddenly started talking about the ray and Professor Persikov."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
